  "sourceText": "Steamed Whitefish\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, February 17, 2010 - 10:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons butter\nSalt\npepper to taste\n3 lbs. whitefish\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Butter upper part of Steamer, arrange cleaned fish in it, season, place over boiling water, cover and steam 15 minutes per pound, remove skin before serving. Serves 6.",
